Z||000021||TRiAD||09-04-2001||07:08 PM||||Thanks to you who have supported me here. I'm glad I checked back.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>It just would have been too sad if no one here could take a joke anymore. <P>2fastom, this thread was NOT directed at you, or I would have posted your thread here (like potiaddict did) and said "hey, check out this loser...". That's just not me. <P>You're not the first, and you won't be the last to "out run" some sportscar in something that never could. I was simply satiring all these events in one over-emphasized version. <P>Thanks again guys...next time I'l remember there are still real people here and not get so excited about the trolls.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR>Oh, and Maniak84, no nitrous, I heard somewhere that hydrogen worked better. hehehe *BOOM!*  hehehe<p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 09-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000022||Pontiaddict||09-04-2001||07:33 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TRiAD:<BR><B>Thanks to you who have supported me here. I'm glad I checked back.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>It just would have been too sad if no one here could take a joke anymore. <P>2fastom, this thread was NOT directed at you, or I would have posted your thread here (like potiaddict</B> [I hope that was just at typo]<B> did) and said "hey, check out this loser...". That's just not me. <P>You're not the first, and you won't be the last to "out run" some sportscar in something that never could. I was simply satiring all these events in one over-emphasized version. <P>Thanks again guys...next time I'l remember there are still real people here and not get so excited about the trolls.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR>Oh, and Maniak84, no nitrous, I heard somewhere that hydrogen worked better. hehehe *BOOM!*  hehehe<P>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 09-04-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Triad, I thought I did get the joke, that's why I posted my own story.<P>As for you claiming that this thread isn't based on the S-2000 one. I still think it's  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> and I really don't believe that you would have posted that you were singling out that thread.<P>2FastTom, I gave you the benifit of the doubt in the other thread, because I don't think it's as improbable as Triad believes it is to beat a S-2000. But your response to him in both threads were rather petty. <p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 09-04-2001).]||||reg||1
